NOTE ON THE ARTWORK

The MIT licence above covers the source code. The illustrations under `assets/`
are licensed separately, under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International (CC BY-SA 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

They were generated with FLUX.2 by Black Forest Labs, through our own API
account. The FLUX licence is explicit that outputs carry no ownership claim by
the model's authors and may be used for any purpose, including commercially, and
that outputs are not derivatives of the model. That grant runs to the holder of
the API key, which is what makes the licence above ours to give.

`scripts/provenance.json` records the model, the exact prompt and the seed for
every generated image, so any of them can be reproduced or checked.

Two sets of assets are not ours and keep their own terms:

  * `assets/game-icons.net.svg-foreground-white/` — CC BY 3.0 or CC0, per the
    `license.txt` in that directory.
  * `assets/badges/` — the F-Droid and GitHub "get it on" badges, each under
    its project's own brand terms.
